{"meta":{"id":"type-conversion","category":"it/syntax/python/types","title":"형 변환 · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"int() · float() · str() · bool(), 자동 변환 없는 강한 타입, isinstance","tags":["python","f-type-transform"],"color":"yellow","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-yellow","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-yellow-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-yellow-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 border border-yellow-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">형 변환 · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-yellow-50/70 border border-yellow-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-yellow-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> int() · float() · str() · bool(), 자동 변환 없는 강한 타입, isinstance</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">형 변환</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">int(&quot;10&quot;)          # 10\r\nint(&quot;3.9&quot;)         # ValueError — float(&quot;3.9&quot;) 후 int()\r\nfloat(&quot;3.14&quot;)      # 3.14\r\nstr(10)            # &quot;10&quot;\r\nbool(&quot;&quot;)           # False — falsy: 0, &quot;&quot;, [], {}, None\r\nlist(&quot;abc&quot;)        # [&#x27;a&#x27;, &#x27;b&#x27;, &#x27;c&#x27;]\r\n\r\n&quot;5&quot; + 2            # TypeError — JS 와 달리 자동 변환 안 함 (강한 타입)\r\nisinstance(x, int) # 타입 확인</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › 형 변환 — JS 는 자동 변환, Python 은 오류</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/types/type-conversion","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/python/types"}],"hasImage":false}